{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05610","headline":"赠酒店胡姬 · 贺朝","name":"赠酒店胡姬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡姬春酒店，弦管夜锵锵。\n红毾铺新月，貂裘坐薄霜。\n玉盘初鱠鲤，金鼎正烹羊。\n上客无劳散，听歌乐世娘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺朝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}